---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="作品集" description="项目、实验与长期工程的整理与展示">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="kicker">Portfolio</p>
    <h1>作品集</h1>
    <p>一些真正做过、正在做，以及值得长期留下来的项目与实验。</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2>代表项目</h2></div>

    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-head">
        <div>
          <h3>Autumn</h3>
          <p class="project-meta">Personal AI System · Ongoing</p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-badge">Ongoing</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">跨树莓派、Windows 和移动设备运行的个人 AI 助手系统，尝试把模型、工具、文件和任务组织成一个统一入口。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-head">
        <div>
          <h3>MajorPath</h3>
          <p class="project-meta">Public-interest · Education · Ongoing</p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-badge">Ongoing</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">帮助高中生看懂大学专业、探索方向，减少盲选的公益网站。</p>
      <p class="project-note">项目正在重构，公开链接会在合适的时候补上。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="project-card cpu-project">
      <div class="project-head">
        <div>
          <h3>8-bit Custom CPU</h3>
          <p class="project-meta">Digital Logic · Multisim · Custom ISA</p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-badge">Completed</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">数字电路课程设计。使用 Multisim 搭建 8 位自定义指令集 CPU，通过 PC、ROM、控制单元、寄存器与 ALU 完成取指、译码、运算和跳转，并用 GCD 程序验证执行流程。</p>
      <div class="portfolio-grid cpu-shot">
        <img src="/portfolio-8bit-custom-cpu.png" alt="8 位自定义指令集 CPU 的 Multisim 仿真总图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-8bit-custom-cpu.png" />
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>实验与成果</h2>
      <span>点击图片可放大查看</span>
    </div>

    <article class="evidence-card">
      <div class="evidence-copy">
        <h3>RISC-V 处理器仿真结构图</h3>
        <p>基于 Logisim 仿真的 8 条指令迷你 RISC-V 处理器（minirv），最终可以打印出"一生一芯"图标。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-grid single">
        <img src="/portfolio-riscv-struct.png" alt="32位 RISC-V 处理器核心模块结构图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-riscv-struct.png" />
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="evidence-card">
      <div class="evidence-copy">
        <h3>STC89C52RC 51单片机核心板</h3>
        <p>使用嘉立创EDA设计的51单片机核心板，USB-C供电、3.3V稳压、12MHz晶振、双层PCB布局，配有完整复位电路、用户LED与按键，全部GPIO引出排针。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-grid">
        <img src="/portfolio-51-pcb-3d.png" alt="51单片机核心板 PCB 3D渲染图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-pcb-3d.png" />
        <img src="/portfolio-51-pcb-layout.png" alt="51单片机核心板 PCB 走线图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-pcb-layout.png" />
        <img src="/portfolio-51-schematic.png" alt="51单片机核心板 原理图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-schematic.png" />
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <div id="lightbox" class="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <button type="button" class="lightbox-close" aria-label="关闭">&times;</button>
    <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
  const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightbox-img');
  const closeBtn = document.querySelector('.lightbox-close');

  if (lightbox && lightboxImg instanceof HTMLImageElement && closeBtn instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
    const close = () => lightbox.classList.remove('active');

    document.querySelectorAll('.portfolio-img.clickable').forEach(img => {
      img.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (!(img instanceof HTMLImageElement)) return;
        lightboxImg.src = img.dataset.full || img.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = img.alt;
        lightbox.classList.add('active');
      });
    });

    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);
    lightbox.addEventListener('click', event => {
      if (event.target === lightbox) close();
    });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
      if (event.key === 'Escape') close();
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-header { max-width: 44rem; padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
  .kicker { color: var(--color-accent-strong); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .page-header h1 { margin: 0.35rem 0 0.4rem; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .page-header > p:last-child { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .section { padding: 1.2rem 0 2.2rem; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .section-heading span { margin-left: auto; color: var(--color-text-faint); font-size: 0.68rem; }

  .project-card, .evidence-card { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; padding: 1.3rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
  .project-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.62rem; }
  .project-head h3, .evidence-copy h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .project-meta { margin: 0.14rem 0 0; color: var(--color-text-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.64rem; }
  .status-badge { margin-left: auto; flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0.18rem 0.42rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.6rem; }
  .card-desc, .evidence-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .project-note { margin: 0.62rem 0 0; color: var(--color-text-faint); font-size: 0.71rem; }

  .portfolio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .portfolio-grid.single { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 26rem); }
  .portfolio-grid.cpu-shot { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 38rem); }
  .cpu-shot .portfolio-img { aspect-ratio: auto; object-fit: contain; background: var(--color-bg-subtle); }
  .portfolio-img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.55rem; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.15s; }
  .portfolio-img:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .lightbox { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(8, 12, 15, 0.9); }
  .lightbox.active { display: flex; }
  .lightbox img { max-width: min(94vw, 1400px); max-height: 90vh; border-radius: 0.65rem; }
  .lightbox-close { position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1.3rem; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #fff; font-size: 2rem; cursor: pointer; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portfolio-grid.single,
    .portfolio-grid.cpu-shot { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-head { align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
